roperty/residential-projects.htm \"Residential Projects in Mumbai\")\n* [Residential Projects in Kandivali West Mumbai](https://www.realestateindia.com/mumbai-property/residential-projects-in-kandivali-west.htm \"Residential Projects in Kandivali West, Mumbai\")\n* Rajesh Raj Residency II in Kandivali West Mumbai\n\n![Rajesh Raj Residency II, Mumbai - Rajesh Raj Residency II](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/wh4/project17075/proj_header_image-17075.jpg)\n\n# Rajesh Raj Residency II\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Flats / Apartments\n\n* [Overview](#pdOverview)\n* [Unit Configuration](#pdPriceRange)\n* [Amenities](#pdAminities)\n* [Gallery](#projectGallery)\n* [Location Map](#pdLocationMap)\n* [About Builder](#pdAboutBuilderProject)\n\nRajesh Raj Residency II Flats / Apartments\n\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img1.jpg)\n\n  Property Type  \n\n  Flats / Apartments\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img2.jpg)\n\n  Configuration  \n\n  2, 3 BHK\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img13.jpg)\n\n  Area of Flats / Apartments  \n\n  1100 - 1680 Sq.ft.\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img4.jpg)\n\n  Possession  \n\n  Jan 2012\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img9.jpg)\n\n  Possession Status  \n\n  Ready to Move\n\n## Unit Configuration\n\n| Unit Type | Area | Price (in ) | Floor Plan |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK+2T | 1100 Sq.ft. (Built Up) | Call for Price |  |\n| 3 BHK | 1680 Sq.ft. (Built Up) | Call for Price |  |\n\n## About Rajesh Raj Residency II\n\nRajesh Raj Residency II, Located Kandivali West in Mumbai, offers well-designed 2 BHK residential apartments for sale. The project is Completed and possession in Jan'12. With its offerings of resident [...read more](javascript:void(0);)\n\n### About Rajesh Raj Residency II\n\nAbout Rajesh Raj Residency II\n\nRajesh Raj Residency II, Located Kandivali West in Mumbai, offers well-designed 2 BHK residential apartments for sale. The project is Completed and possession in Jan'12. With its offerings of residential apartments with area ranging sq ft., these residential apartments marked as a Raj Residency II as one of the most detailed yet affordable residential projects in Kandivali West. The amenities which is provided Children's play area and Landscaped Garden.\n\n## Amenities\n\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/kids-play-area.jpg)\n\n  Kids Play Area\n* ![Landspace Garden](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/landspace-garden.jpg)\n\n  Landspace Garden\n\n## Image Gallery of this Project\n\n![](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/wh3/project17075/proj_header_image-17075.jpg)\n\n## Location Map of Rajesh Raj Residency II\n\n## About Rajesh LifeSpaces\n\nFor over five decades, Rajesh LifeSpaces has added to its portfolio a string of residential and commercial projects that range from budget homes and future-ready apartments to elegant office spaces an [...Read more](javascript:void(0);)\n\n### About Rajesh LifeSpaces\n\nAbout Rajesh LifeSpaces\n\nFor over five decades, Rajesh LifeSpaces has added to its portfolio a string of residential and commercial projects that range from budget homes and future-ready apartments to elegant office spaces and plush retail hubs. Every space we have built is a celebration of life. Today, our legacy of crafting unique spaces, our strong business ethics and unwavering commitment to quality, sets us apart in the real estate industry. It has been our privilege to create homes that feel like home to more than 13,000 happy families. And we look forward to creating more for the families tomorrow.\n\n139, Nagindas Master Road, 2nd Floor, Seksaria Chambers, Fort, Mumbai 400 023, Fort, Mumbai, Maharashtra\n\n## Other Projects of this Builder\n\n![](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/project17064/proj_header_image-17064-350x350.jpeg)\n\nRajesh Raj Manor\n\n[Rajesh Raj Manor](https://www.realestateindia.com/projects/rajesh-raj-manor-by-rajesh-lifespaces-in-malad-west-mumbai/)\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\nCall for Price\n\n2,000 /Sq.ft.\n\n3 BHK Apartment\n\n![](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/project17065/proj_header_image-17065-350x350.jpeg)\n\nRajesh Raj Sarovar\n\n[Rajesh Raj Sarovar](https://www.realestateindia.com/projects/rajesh-raj-sarovar-by-rajesh-lifespaces-in-borivali-west-mumbai-pjid-17065/)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\nCall for Price\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n![](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/project17066/proj_header_image-17066-350x350.jpg)\n\nRajesh Raj Garden\n\n[Rajesh Raj Garden](https://www.realestateindia.com/projects/rajesh-raj-garden-by-rajesh-lifespaces-in-kandivali-west-mumbai/)\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\nCall for Price\n\n1, 2 BHK Apartment\n\n![](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/project17073/proj_header_image-17073-350x350.jpg)\n\nRajesh Raj Galaxy II\n\n[Rajesh Raj Galaxy II](https://www.realestateindia.com/projects/rajesh-raj-galaxy-ii-by-rajesh-lifespaces-in-santacruz-east-mumbai/)\n\nSantacruz East, Mumbai\n\nCall for Price\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n![](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/project17074/proj_header_image-17074-350x350.jpg)\n\nRajesh Raj Arcade II\n\n[Rajesh Raj Arcade II](https://www.realestateindia.com/projects/rajesh-raj-arcade-ii-by-rajesh-lifespaces-in-kandivali-west-mumbai/)\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\nCall for Price\n\n1, 2 BHK Apartment\n\n![](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/project17076/proj_header_image-17076-350x350.jpg)\n\nRajesh Raj Anmol I\n\n[Rajesh Raj Anmol I](https://www.realestateindia.com/projects/rajesh-raj-anmol-i-by-rajesh-lifespaces-in-borivali-west-mumbai-pjid-17076/)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\nCall for Price\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n![](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/project17077/proj_header_image-