sidency II](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h310_w462/Project-Photo-9-Raj-Residency-II-Mumbai-5056084_960_1280_310_462.JPEG)\n\n![Image 22: Project Entrance in Raj Residency II](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h310_w462/Project-Photo-6-Raj-Residency-II-Mumbai-5056084_960_1280_310_462.JPEG)\n\n![Image 23: View from Gate in Raj Residency II](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h310_w462/Project-Photo-3-Raj-Residency-II-Mumbai-5056084_960_1280_310_462.JPEG)\n\nSee All Photos/Videos\n\n## About[Kandivali West](https://www.magicbricks.com/Kandivali-West-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\n![Image 24: Kandivali West](https://img.staticmb.com/mbphoto/locality/cropped_images/2020/Sep/22/Photo_h600_w900/78867_IMG_20200121_145312967---Altaf-Khan_600_900.jpg)\n\n4.3\n\n367 reviews\n\nRank\n\n269 out of 3015 localities \n\nLocality Average Price\n\n₹ 20774/sq.ft + ₹495 (2.4% ) QoQ\n\nLocality introduction and neighbourhood\n\nThings to keep in mind\n\n*   Availability of a wide range of residential properties \n\n[Explore Kandivali West](https://www.magicbricks.com/Kandivali-West-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\n## About Rajesh Builders\n\n![Image 25: Rajesh Builders](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/photo_dir/developer/original_images/64883/Rajesh-Builders-1402904653608-Rajesh-Builders-1388591288009-Developer-Logo.gif)\n\n[Rajesh Builders](https://www.magicbricks.com/rajesh-builders-buid-4d423634383833)\n\nTotal Projects\n\n14\n\nProjects Completed\n\n12\n\nProjects Ongoing\n\n2\n\nExplore Builder Contact Seller\n\nFor close to five decades, Rajesh Builders has been earning acclaim for its passion invested towards building monuments of fine urban living, corporat... Read More\n\nAbout Developer\n\nFor close to five decades, Rajesh Builders has been earning acclaim for its passion invested towards building monuments of fine urban living, corporate spaces and hospitality destinations. For creations that are a beautiful melange of ideas, designs and engineering – creations that resonate with a higher level of appreciation.\n\nWhat began as a pioneering vision to build houses that Mumbai citizens will use proudly, translated into some of the most accomplished constructions in the world of architecture and engineering. Our founding father, Shri Raghavji bhai Patel advocated working and reworking on concepts to the last details before proceeding to the design board. It is this approach to business and desire to excel that is clearly evident in all our designs.\n\nWith more than 5 million sq. ft. of developed property, 55 multi-storied structures across the western and central suburbs, we have fortified our strong beliefs and time honoured principles into developing India’s finest megapolis, Mumbai. From sprawling residential complexes across the city, an opulent business complex in Bhandup, a five-star hotel in Powai to a dream resort in Karjat, we have forayed far beyond the realms of conventional construction. All built real, and built true.\n\n[![Image 26: Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner](https://cdn.staticmb.com/pdpstatic/images/magic-Interior_878-x-403.jpg)](https://property.magicbricks.com/microsite/lp/patabadlolifebadlo/?inc=pblb_web_pdp_pblbbanner_belowhibannere)\n\nIf you like Raj Residency II,\n\nDon't miss these similar projects\n\n![Image 27](https://cdn.staticmb.com/pdpstatic/images/logo-magic-homes-animation.svg)\n\n![Image 28: Pebble La Serena Tower 5 Tower 6 and Tower 7 photo](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h240_w0/2024/04/10/Project-Photo-1-LA-SERENA-Tower-5-Tower-6-and-Tower-7-Mumbai-5418891_345_1366_240_0.jpg)\n\n₹ 2.36 Cr - 5.20 Cr\n\n[Pebble La Serena Tower 5 Tower 6 and Tower 7](https://www.magicbricks.com/pebble-la-serena-tower-5-tower-6-and-tower-7-kandivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343138383931)\n\nKandivali West\n\n2, 3 BHK\n\nView Phone No.\n\n![Image 29: Rock Highland photo](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h240_w0/2024/07/05/Project-Photo-6-Rock-Highland-Mumba